s/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-03T21:36:47Z","updated_at":"2022-12-03T21:36:47Z","body":"+1 to add. As noted above, easily meets the \"open source-ish\" prong of the license inclusion principles, and inclusion in Debian and Fedora meets requirement of broad usage.\r\n\r\nI note that the [Debian package's copyright file](https://metadata.ftp-master.debian.org/changelogs//main/s/symlinks/symlinks_1.4-4_copyright) also includes both paragraphs as @richardfontana indicated, so also +1 in including both in the license text.\r\n\r\nFrom a quick search I don't see any other instances of this for other packages, so I'm inclined to add it verbatim without markup for other projects, etc.\r\n\r\nThis makes 3 +1's, so will mark as accepted unless any material objection in next few days.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1336262491/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1340253345","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1608#issuecomment-1340253345","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1608","id":1340253345,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85P4qSh","user":{"login":"Pizza-Ria","id":46799628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Nzk5NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46799628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizza-Ria","followers_url":"ht